* Mesh style multi-peer linking
  - Each server should be able to peer to any number of peers
  - We should track latency, loss, weight, etc metrics for each hop
  - Build shortest path and lowest latency route cache
  - Some algorithm to decide which paths to send messages to
    such that they'll reach all subscribed nodes without duplication
    or sending down unrelated tree branches
  - Attempt re-routing internally as needed due to loss or latency

